WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Ryu charges Denjin while Ken is stunned in the corner.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Ryu hits the stunned opponent with jumping heavy kick.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.400
Ryu continues the grounded sequence with the low follow-up.

4
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.500
Ryu connects the enhanced Hashogeki as blue energy surrounds Ken.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.600
Ryu continues the corner juggle into Shoryuken.

6
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.300
Ken lands at the corner after the Shoryuken finish.
